results.description:
Most of the successful people use routines in their everyday life to boost their productivity and improve quality of life.

UTRO - the best way to prepare for your day and make it as productive and focused as possible. 

The goal of the app is to make passing of your routine as easy as possible to help you get more done everyday, which will have a massive impact on your life. 

Use UTRO to stay motivated & focused on what's really important in your life. 

With UTRO you can:

1. Create not only morning routine, but also evening routine to sleep better with unlimited habits in each routine! 
2. Find inspiration - use routines of the most successful people in the world; 
3. Stay in control - choose weekdays per routine with friendly reminders;
4. Google calendar integration - your routine will be showed in your calendar, so you can easily plan your day;
5. Be more focused and productive - smart routine player lets you know when to change your activity.
